      "description": "Write a batch of CANDIDATE records for human review — nothing becomes case data until a person accepts it in the app. 1-25 proposals per call, each {entityType, payload, externalRef?, note?}; payload mirrors the target entity's wire shape. Proposable entity types: creditors, claims, assets, employments, pay_period_records, other_income_records, income_summaries, households, expenses, dependents, codebtors, sofa_entries, petitions, prior_cases, related_cases, sole_proprietorships, filing_professionals, exemptions, contract_leases, community_household_members, means_test_inputs, plans, debtors.",
